<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.1.1>	Refulgent clara huius templi culmina
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.1.2>	Perfusus luce septiformis spiritus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.1.3>	Christi rubescunt purpurata sanguine,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.1.4>	Perlita rore pretiosi balsami
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.1.5>	Hodore flagrant mixtis aromatibus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.2.1>	Sint semper istam supra domum, domine,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.2.2>	Tui aperti, deprecamur, oculi,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.2.3>	Auresque tuae sint intentae iugiter
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.2.4>	Diem per omnem noctis et in tempore,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.2.5>	Tuoque semper ore benedicito.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.3.1>	Sint angelorum hic alta frequentia,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.3.2>	Descendat omnis huc caelestis gratia,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.3.3>	Diffusa sancto largiente spiritu,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.3.4>	Uultu sereno sancta semper trinitas,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.3.5>	Pio fauore dignetur inspicere.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.4.1>	Nubes sacrata, quo pendens incubuit
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.4.2>	Deo iubente supra tabernaculi
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.4.3>	Tectum, beatus quod Moyses in eremo
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.4.4>	Fixit, precamur, huius aulae menia
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.4.5>	Afflata sancto perfundat spiramine.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.5.1>	Famosa dudum quae repleuit atria
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.5.2>	Templi dicati, nebula perlucida
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.5.3>	Orante puro Salomone pectore,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.5.4>	Hanc, Christe, caeli missa de cacumine
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.5.5>	Domum fecundet sempiterno munere.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.6.1>	Quicumque tuum sanctum nomen supplici
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.6.2>	Plenoque corde deprecatus fuerit
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.6.3>	Huius in aedis sancto domicilio,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.6.4>	Te largiente, sit liber a crimine.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.6.5>	Exclude pestem, morbos omnes dilue.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.7.1>	Tuo sacrato hic depasti corpore
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.7.2>	Tuoque sancto satiati sanguine,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.7.3>	Ab oste tuo defensi munimine
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.7.4>	Leti fideles sortiantur seruuli
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.7.5>	Uitae perennis sine fine gaudia.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.8.1>	Rerum creator, Iesu, patris unice,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.8.2>	Mundum cruore saluas qui purpureo,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.8.3>	Peccata tollis solus qui pestifera,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.8.4>	Dignare tuos munere gratuito
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.8.5>	Ad astra caeli mittere ruriculas.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.9.1>	Sit semper alta deo patri gloria,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.9.2>	Omnis potestas sit dilecto filio,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.9.3>	Sanctoque semper gloria paraclito,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.9.4>	Honor et uirtus, laus, decus, imperium
<paulin_aquil. carm. 15.9.5>	Et nunc et ultra sit per cuncta saecula.
